  "content": "<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2f3jmM.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"321\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">冬季翻新模組是為了MMD 2021冬季開發大賽而誕生的。它將為Minecraft的冰雪生態域帶來全新的冬季相關功能！<br><br><strong>頭飾</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2KGEuM.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"176\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你可以自己穿戴，也可以給雪人戴上，解鎖各種全新的能力！<br><br><strong>可自訂的雪人：<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7l446mx.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"176\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">雪人現在會隨機生成手臂、鈕扣和臉部的組合——超過1000種變化！<br><br><strong>知更鳥：<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9W4zqCA.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"176\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">牠們很喜歡甜莓果 &lt;3</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lXrggZqaE60?wmode=transparent\" width=\"319\" height=\"319\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美術設計<br>ThatGravyBoat - 模組程式編寫<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 為Minecraft添加精彩生物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 添加各式友善動物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong> - 為你的世界添加兩種友善的幽靈生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nightlights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Night Lights</a></strong>&nbsp;- 添加大量不同種類的裝飾性光源！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a></strong>&nbsp;- 為遊戲添加60種全新的近戰武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 全面改造原版苦力怕的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 全面改造原版終界使者的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a> </strong>- 全面改造原版鐵魔像的模組！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></a>&nbsp;- 添加沼澤村莊，裡面住著名為蛙人的小村民！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fcJhzdU.png\" width=\"887\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/4iErMz2\" alt=\"\"></p>",
